{{% alert title="Note" color="warning" %}}
Azure Redis managed service does not support the RedisJson module and cannot be used with query.
{{% /alert %}}

{{% /tab %}}

{{% tab "AWS" %}}
Follow instructions for [Redis deployment in AWS](#setup-redis).
